{"id":"n24938-2-7","stage":2,"title":"천국 · 天堂","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24938-2-7-1","ko":"우와, 여기에 너랑 내가 좋아하는 과일이 가득해.","zh":"哇，这里到处都是你和我喜欢的水果呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우와,","meaning":"哇","explanation":"우와：哇。","readings":[{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:우와:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"우와","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우와","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3"}},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"너랑","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너랑","audio":"/audio/32c7250ffa53acbc7ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하는","audio":"/audio/2b4807c27825ce3100ef.mp3"}},{"text":"과일이","meaning":"水果","explanation":"과일：水果；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"과일","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18264","senseId":"1","lemma":"과일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과일이","audio":"/audio/194804d6db7b8c2716fd.mp3"}},{"text":"가득해.","meaning":"满满","explanation":"가득하다：满满；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가득하다","audio":"/audio/8a8f066d91aa18afc6b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62252","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득해","audio":"/audio/655a2e8c27398c0d92a1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d727fbbe4b971d2","term":"우와","zh":"哇","audio":"/audio/2d727fbbe4b971d2bc9b.mp3","definition":"惊讶、赞叹时的感叹。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"ed0e90733d1a21cf","term":"과일","zh":"水果","audio":"/audio/ed0e90733d1a21cf0b03.mp3","entryId":"18264","definition":"苹果、梨、葡萄、栗子等主要长在树上的，人们可以食用的果子。","pronunciation":["과ː일"]},{"id":"8a8f066d91aa18af","term":"가득하다","zh":"满满","audio":"/audio/8a8f066d91aa18afc6b4.mp3","entryId":"62252","definition":"事物或人多得没有空隙。","pronunciation":["가드카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17d3bc0328ca0e7bf4f2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24938-2-7-2","ko":"정말 이곳이야말로 과일 천국이구나!","zh":"真的，这里简直就是水果的天堂啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/a